  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="article reveal">
        <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a> / <a href="kenya.html">Kenya</a> / The Great Migration</nav>
        <p class="article__lead">Front-row seats to the greatest wildlife spectacle on earth. From July to October, more than a million wildebeest and zebra brave the crocodile-filled rivers of the Maasai Mara — and you'll watch it unfold from hand-picked camps right on their path.</p>
        <p>Six unhurried days in big-cat country, paced for wonder rather than ticking boxes. Fully tailor-made, and lovely as a women-only departure.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Day by day</p><h2 class="section__title">Your 6-day journey</h2></div>
      <div class="days">
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 1</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Welcome to Nairobi</h3><p>Met on arrival and taken to a gracious city hotel to rest and settle in.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Nairobi hotel · <b>Meals:</b> Dinner</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 2</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Fly to the Maasai Mara</h3><p>A scenic flight over the Rift Valley, then settle into camp and head out for a golden-hour game drive.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Luxury tented camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 3</div><div class="day__body"><h3>River crossings</h3><p>With your guide tracking the herds, position for the drama of a Mara River crossing — wildebeest and zebra in their thousands.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Luxury tented camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 4</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Big cats &amp; a balloon dawn</h3><p>An optional hot-air-balloon flight at sunrise with bush breakfast, then lions, cheetah and leopard through the day.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Luxury tented camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 5</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Conservancy &amp; community</h3><p>Move to a private conservancy for quieter sightings, a walking safari, and time with a Maasai community on their terms.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Conservancy camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 6</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Return to Nairobi &amp; farewell</h3><p>Fly back to Nairobi for your onward flight — or continue to Zanzibar for a few barefoot days.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
