          <li>Female guides where possible</li>
          <li>24/7 Rendile concierge</li>
          <li>All gratuities to guides &amp; staff</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:1.2rem;color:var(--ink-soft)">From <strong>$6,800 per person sharing</strong>. Best July–October for river crossings; resident wildlife year-round. International flights, visas and the optional balloon flight are extra.</p>
